rompt_submit.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/detached_prompt_submit.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-185[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-185/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pending launch lifecycle and detached relaunch waits[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pending-launch[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pending-launch: add the PendingLaunch record, restore helper, pending [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]proc row, `,X` cancel of not-yet-submitted launches, and quit-time [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stash; unmount the bar ahead of the relaunch-cleanup/pending-kill holds;[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]move the synchronous post-unmount tail (MRU write, bulk Patch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution) off the UI thread.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hold and provider guards run after the bar unmounts[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]detached-guards[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pending-launch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detached-guards: move the acceptance point ahead of the `%hold` and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hard-disabled-provider preflights, re-key both guards per pending launch[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with non-exclusive workers, and surface their decisions without stealing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]focus, restoring or stashing the prompt on abort.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Dispatch source preflight becomes a pending-launch stage[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]detached-dispatch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after detached-guards[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detached-dispatch: post the submit immediately for `%dispatch` prompts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](syntax errors still keep the bar) and run the source preview as the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first pending-launch stage, restoring the prompt with the blocked-source[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line on failure.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prompt keystroke paths stop loading the project-tag catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]keystroke-tag-catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keystroke-tag-catalog: add snapshot-only effective-tag helpers and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]convert keystroke, render, and submit-handler callers so typing and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Enter never revalidate or rebuild the project-tag catalog on the UI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]thread.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-185","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-185.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-75bc9976367e886584fe6447a72ae13f","started_at":"2026-09-24T19:15:19.869989+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1790282668,"sha":"a21985b88fe2de892bb221d3a5ab4fa1cec285b7","subject":"feat(ace): detach dispatch source preflight (sase-185.3)"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"50fb3ef5e5453b63ede6a41b7299ae07a2b3b1ae2df71fdaa3324fd70c8ad431","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.3/chat.md","size_bytes":4049},"commits":{"digest":"e99cf766c56ae4c2e68f87cbeb74a1707e0e85235e435248360573158513a6d4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-185.3/commits.json","size_bytes":234},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-18